From 9a326f50fb88ffd83fb19c536be5fb292227d4a9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matthew <matthewhale@live.com.au>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 07:32:51 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 49/59] TIE Fighter's Alt+T time acceleration (1x/2x/4x)

Live flight renders one frame in every 2 or 4 and runs the others back to
back (flight_sim returns CONTINUE so the host does not present or wait).
Reset to 1x when the player craft is created. Not recorded in films.
---
